/ an event a test binds while it runs is its own: bound on every step's start, it runs for this test's steps.
Start
- set %seen% = 0
- on %!app.type.step.on.start%, before, call Seen
- set %after% = 1
- assert %seen% is greater than 0, "the event ran for this test's own steps"

Seen
- set %seen% = %seen% + 1
